Third-party material
--------------------

src/formula/functions.rs is generated from Apache POI's
functionMetadata.txt and functionMetadataCetab.txt
(https://github.com/apache/poi), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). Apache POI's
NOTICE file says:

    Apache POI
    Copyright 2003-2026 The Apache Software Foundation

    This product includes software developed at
    The Apache Software Foundation (https://www.apache.org/).

The test files in tests/data/ keep their own licenses: Apache POI's under
Apache-2.0 and calamine's under MIT. tests/data/NOTICE lists them.

No code from Apache POI or calamine is copied here; the record layouts
follow Microsoft's [MS-XLS] specification and, for BIFF2 to BIFF4, the
descriptions in Apache POI's Old*Record classes and the OpenOffice.org
"Excel File Format" document.
